{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4885238","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年宗像大社学习之旅","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"在福冈宗像参加三天学习会，探访新原奴山古坟群与宗像大社，感受历史遗迹与神社的独特力量。","date":"2016-07-10","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 宗像大社","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 宗像大社","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4885238.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160713014325id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4885238.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","勉強"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":509,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4885238/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/001-95bd25f8e6.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[639,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"在福冈宗像参加三天学习会，探访新原奴山古坟群与宗像大社，感受历史遗迹与神社的独特力量。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我现在人在九州的福冈县宗像市！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这次是为期三天两夜的学习会！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">和各位出色的老师一起</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">进行广泛的学习</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">首先是</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">新原・奴山古坟群</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">还有古坟顶部的遗迹！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/001-95bd25f8e6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/001-95bd25f8e6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n上下：Snow Peak公司的防虫连帽外套\n\n蚊子多得不得了，不过连脸也能防护住，蚊子根本靠不过来！\n<br>\n\n\n买得真值！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n增田\n其实我很喜欢古坟\n\n小学五年级左右\n\n甚至还用零花钱\n买过一本将近1000日元的\n古坟书（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n所以……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n情绪高涨起来了（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/002-69de6adfbe.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/002-69de6adfbe.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n法国之行的疲惫根本不算什么（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n没想到宗像竟然有这么多古坟\n真是吓了一跳！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/003-0e5315c13c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/003-0e5315c13c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n从5世纪到6世纪修建的圆坟和前方后圆坟，竟然有48座！\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n圆坟圆滚滚的，很可爱，\n前方后圆坟的形状\n又神秘又不可思议\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n所以说……\n\n<br>\n\n\n总觉得我就是喜欢古坟呢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n然后\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n一直想来看看\n宗像大社边津宫（末女神）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/004-2fa03ba484.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/004-2fa03ba484.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n仿佛会温暖地迎接人们\n真是非常棒的入口\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/005-e9c81f9aa4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/005-e9c81f9aa4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n我在这里\n穿上西装进行了正式参拜！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n九州这边的人似乎都知道这里\n因为这里很有名，可以祈求行车安全，\n不过宗像大社是日本引以为傲的神圣之地\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/006-f3f5f7bf97.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/006-f3f5f7bf97.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n接着\n向更高处走去\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n高宫祭场\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/007-e978aa4668.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/007-e978aa4668.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n这是一个让人感受到某种神秘力量的地方\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n空气的感觉、声音，还有场所本身的力量\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n这一天不只是增长了知识\n我还感受到了宗像大社的力量！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">九州は福岡県宗像市に来ています！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今回は2泊3日の勉強会！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">素晴らしい先生方と共に</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">幅広く勉強します</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">まずは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">新原・奴山古墳群</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">古墳の上部にある遺跡と共に！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/001-95bd25f8e6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/001-95bd25f8e6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n上下 : Snow peak社 インセクトシールドパーカー\n\nものすごい蚊がいたけど顔もシールドできて蚊を寄せ付けず！\n<br>\n\n\n買って良かった！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nマスダ\n実は古墳好きで\n\n小学校5年生頃に\n\nお小遣いで1000円近くする\n\n古墳の本を買ったほど（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nなので・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nテンション上がってます（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/002-69de6adfbe.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/002-69de6adfbe.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nフランスの疲れもなんのその（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宗像にこんなにも古墳があるなんて\n驚きました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/003-0e5315c13c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/003-0e5315c13c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n5世紀から6世紀に作られた円墳と前方後円墳が48も！\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n円墳は丸っこくてかわいいですし\n前方後円墳はその形状が\n謎で不思議\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nだからかな・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n何か古墳て好きなんですよね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n来てみたかった\n宗像大社 辺津宮（末女神）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/004-2fa03ba484.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/004-2fa03ba484.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n温かく迎え入れてくれるような\n素晴らしい入口\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/005-e9c81f9aa4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/005-e9c81f9aa4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nここで\nスーツを着て正式参拝しました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n九州の方には車の安全祈願で\n有名らしいですが\n宗像大社は日本が誇る凄いところ\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/006-f3f5f7bf97.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/006-f3f5f7bf97.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさらに\n高台の方へ\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n高宮祭場\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/007-e978aa4668.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4885238/007-e978aa4668.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n何か不思議なチカラを感じる場所でした\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n空気感や音  場所のチカラ\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n知識だけではなく\n宗像大社のチカラを感じた1日でした！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>"}}